{"title":"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/8/508344a94012942aba5d50c098b46782032117eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+\\sin t)(1+\\cos t)=5/4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"208\" height=\"18\" /> and\n</p>\n<dl><dd><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf29d52380b6425977553a19ef91fe310d5153cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-\\sin t)(1-\\cos t)=\\frac mn-\\sqrt{k},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"252\" height=\"33\" /></dd></dl>\n<p>where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/e/9be5d485dcae782038966ded5d721580c2684ea0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k, m,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/b/c8b61c20d22f13c0586a382c14a5710b6a4afe1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_{}$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> are positive integers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/6/4d68403b2262cd441edb65005adf53304fdfda5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m_{}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"8\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/b/c8b61c20d22f13c0586a382c14a5710b6a4afe1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_{}$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> relatively prime, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/9/7b938e45e4c61c568a882907d33b3cf3258aad6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k+m+n.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the givens, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/6/9f6701074c80250e1921616aa9be99d0d98eae30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sin t \\cos t + 2 \\sin t + 2 \\cos t = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"251\" height=\"37\" />, and adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/561bd23eb5e1abab5ee31bb33dad768ab27d70ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^2 t + \\cos^2t = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"135\" height=\"17\" /> to both sides gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/1/541b88922e34fc127442aeee3778c86484327c03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sin t + \\cos t)^2 + 2(\\sin t + \\cos t) = \\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"279\" height=\"37\" />.  Completing the square on the left in the variable <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/7/2975284f66c5bac6762a6930ce02ab899d427d36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sin t + \\cos t)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e103a97cc2ad85df849c1ad8d89082ea068b810.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin t + \\cos t = -1 \\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{5}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"189\" height=\"43\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/f/26fedbc639bfa0fa2ea6e46ca9a4b5cdeecebec7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|\\sin t + \\cos t| \\leq \\sqrt 2 &lt; 1 + \\sqrt{\\frac{5}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"236\" height=\"43\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c5218a04f4d97b1856ab8770a2a1533547a765e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin t + \\cos t = \\sqrt{\\frac{5}{2}} - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"173\" height=\"43\" />.  Subtracting twice this from our original equation gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/e/13e15e144c618b73727d4f875cf882256e570f41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sin t - 1)(\\cos t - 1) = \\sin t \\cos t - \\sin t - \\cos t + 1 = \\frac{13}{4} - \\sqrt{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"494\" height=\"38\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/0/c60469ed9b33b497d26472832d1d8e3e318f7845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13 + 4 + 10 = \\boxed{027}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/6/7166648a07a07159cfe2360abe1e2239655869ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 - \\sin t)(1 - \\cos t) = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"191\" height=\"18\" />. Multiplying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> with the given equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/5/a25c8cf927e0a060f9fa634aa3909ae16dade94e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5x}{4} = (1 - \\sin^2 t)(1 - \\cos^2 t) = \\sin^2 t \\cos ^2 t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"329\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/1/d31dffd00fa05c76ae895412abbbea5985bdae38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{5x}}{2} = \\sin t \\cos t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"131\" height=\"41\" />. Simplifying and rearranging the given equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/9/089ec31f612df5b2421df07bd794a9d2d6d68e1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin t + \\cos t = \\frac{5}{4} - (\\sin^2 t + \\cos^2 t) - \\sin t \\cos t = \\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{\\sqrt{5x}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"452\" height=\"41\" />. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/0/ab03cfb7c02c75540b8b4b752b14851d072493e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 + \\sin t)(1 + \\cos t) - 2(\\sin t + \\cos t) = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"327\" height=\"20\" />, and substituting, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/7/177af89d96075fe8a5410235635154ce4ae3d0c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{5}{4} - 2( \\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{\\sqrt{5x}}{2}) = \\frac{3}{4} + \\sqrt{5x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"261\" height=\"41\" />. Rearranging and squaring, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/8/c889901bf03ab4d1a5828c3ef22066fc98f5a69b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x = x^2 - \\frac{3}{2} x + \\frac{9}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"150\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/d/c4db583b0d02e212ac96cc0712a4fdc4397fad3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - \\frac{13}{2} x + \\frac{9}{16} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"149\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/9/a89122a33f7a73c2ce30c2f335a5a12e3cf875fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{13}{4} \\pm \\sqrt{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"114\" height=\"38\" />, but clearly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/c/cec57832076e2a6cc425d34b882778f8a27e37bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\leq x &lt; 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/5/9e5d0122c6ce2f99c5ff65b4911d10312dd4fed8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{13}{4} - \\sqrt{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/0/c60469ed9b33b497d26472832d1d8e3e318f7845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13 + 4 + 10 = \\boxed{027}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We want <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9e6ef1e6ec8270d95338630761f3f63c0629f9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+\\sin t \\cos t-\\sin t-\\cos t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"210\" height=\"13\" />. However, note that we only need to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/4/bc4b79e51f5a62e4b3fb8e9c833ff3f5a9794d40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin t+\\cos t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/8/558e15a5feb3278780c7224f62b6a788db134cbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\sin t+\\cos t \\rightarrow y^2 = \\sin^2 t + \\cos^2 t + 2\\sin t \\cos t = 1 + 2\\sin t \\cos t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"536\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>From this we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/8/018b7353dea4aebfc3c901825d6cd4fdf6bf0c65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin t \\cos t = \\frac{y^2-1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"143\" height=\"39\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/a/cea03d3b779cbc258562bda052fed9515ea475f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin t + \\cos t = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Substituting, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/5/175dcb9cd4efeeff597b17527b1870074a07ea4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y^2+4y-3=0 \\rightarrow y = \\frac {-2 \\pm \\sqrt{10}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"275\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/5/ae5c636ead6d260371888851b3ea63ba309825ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{4} - 2(\\frac{-2+\\sqrt{10}}{2}) = \\frac{13}{4}-\\sqrt{10} \\rightarrow 13+10+4=\\boxed{027}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"426\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME\" title=\"1995 AIME\">1995 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017185047\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 259/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7438/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.155      1 -total\n 58.92%    7.751      1 Template:AIME_box\n 38.62%    5.080      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2971:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017185047 and revision id 261492. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}